# Copy to `.env` to override the API the app talks to.
# Omit the file entirely to use the deployed production API
# (https://dmrc-rest-api.vercel.app).
#
# Use the origin only — paths include `/api/v1` or `/api/v2` themselves.
# Older values that end in `/api/v1` are still accepted and stripped.

# Local backend, iOS simulator / web:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Local backend, Android emulator (10.0.2.2 maps to the host loopback):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000

# Local backend, physical device on the same network:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.10:8000

# The web build leaves this unset: the Cloudflare Worker that serves the site
# also proxies `/api/*`, so `src/config/env.ts` uses the page's own origin.
